== Trivia ==
* {{dlc+|r}} The {{e|Wizoob}} and {{e|Red Ghost}} are the only entities whose Stage HP were reduced in ''Repentance'', both from 5 to 4.{{dlc-}}
** {{dlc+|r+}} And once again, in ''Repentance+'', both from 4 to 3.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} The Monster with the lowest Stage HP (and with the lowest amount among all entities) is the {{e|Swarm Spider}} at 0.2, while the Monster with the highest is the {{e|Holy Bony}} with a staggering 14, nearly twice the amount of 2nd place. All other Monsters have an amount between 1 and 8.{{dlc-}}
* The Boss with the highest Stage HP (and with the highest amount among all entities) is a tie between {{e|Krampus}} and {{e|The Fallen}} at 45. All other Bosses have an amount between 7.5 and 30.

